abstract: "Population- and area-weighted crosswalks between the tehsil and district frames of Pakistan's censuses (1998 report frame and census-day frame, 2017, 2023), a district crosswalk from the 1951-1981 maps, a dated register of boundary changes with sources, and a population panel 1951-2023 on the 2023 units. Built for Professor M. Yasir Khan (University of Pittsburgh)."
